flowchart LR
    SoldView[SecondhandSoldView] --> OrderAPI[OrderController]
    DetailView[SecondhandOrderDetailView] --> OrderAPI
    DetailView --> LogisticsAPI[LogisticsController]
    OrderAPI --> OrderService[OrderServiceImpl]
    LogisticsAPI --> LogisticsService[LogisticsServiceImpl]
    OrderService --> OrderMapper[OrderInfoMapper]
    OrderService --> ItemMapper[OrderItemMapper]
    OrderService --> LogisticsService
    OrderService --> Settlement[EscrowSettlementService]
    Settlement --> Strategy[SecondhandSettlementStrategy]
    Settlement --> BalanceMapper[BalanceMapper]
    Settlement --> RecordMapper[TransactionRecordMapper]
    LogisticsService --> TemplateMapper[LogisticsPathTemplateMapper]
    LogisticsService --> TraceMapper[LogisticsTraceMapper]
    OrderService -. 提交后 best-effort .-> Notify[NotificationService]
    OrderService -. 提交后 best-effort .-> Realtime[RealtimePushService]
    OrderMapper --> DB[(MySQL)]
    ItemMapper --> DB
    BalanceMapper --> DB
    RecordMapper --> DB
    TemplateMapper --> DB
    TraceMapper --> DB
